### 로그인
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "securePass123"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("token", "Bearer " + response.body.accessToken);
%}

### 가게 검색
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/stores/search
Content-Type: application/json

### 특정 가게 메뉴 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/stores/1/menus

### 가게 등록
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/stores
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId" : 4,
  "userId" : 3,
  "name": "분식집",
  "phone" : "01012345678",
  "roadAddress" : "춘천시 안마산로 112-1",
  "detailAddress" : "지하 1층",
  "introduction" :  "분식집입니다~.",
  "minOrderPrice" : 10000,
  "deliveryFee" : 4000,
  "openStatus" : false
}

### 가게 대표 이미지 등록 API
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/owner/stores/1/image
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=BOUNDARY123

--BOUNDARY123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="chicken.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< /Users/minjiwon/Desktop/bappul/api/catalog/chicken.jpeg
--BOUNDARY123--

### 가게 상세 조회
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/stores/1

### 가게 위치 정보 조회
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/stores/1/location
